INFO:MLEvolve:Reasoning: The pipeline correctly isolates all stateful preprocessing: the feature engineer, categorical indexer, target-encoding global maps, imputation values, neural net, GBDT, ExtraTrees, blend weights, and threshold are fit only on training rows (per CV fold), with OOF target encodings used for training rows so a row's own label never contributes to its feature. Validation-fold rows and final test rows receive target encoding only via maps built on training labels, and prediction reloads the persisted bundle without refitting. The metric (accuracy) matches the supervisor-computed accuracy, predictions use original labels, output columns/row_ids follow the contract, and inference uses real model probabilities rather than constants. No P0 leakage or P1 critical bug is present.
